export anchor StainedGlassNightStyle:
    number: 319
    screen: OpsMonitor
    name: Stained glass night
    idea: The whole monitor is one leaded window seen at night, with deep jewel glass panes held in thick black lead, an arched head pane for traffic, five round arched lancets for the services, and pale glowing text on every pane.
    base: dark
    palette:
        night: #08070b, the page
        lead: #020203, the window frame, the gaps between panes, roundel rims and list rules
        ink: #f7f1e6, text on every pane
        pale: #d7cdbd, captions, times and axis on every pane
        ruby: #3b0f1d, the incident pane and the sync-worker lancet
        sapphire: #0f1f45, the head pane, the api lancet and the current app
        emerald: #0b3424, the latency pane and the web lancet
        amethyst: #2b1547, the error pane and the notifications lancet
        amberGlass: #3b2608, the alerts pane, the billing lancet and list rows
        slateGlass: #1a1a22, the deploys pane and the style sheet
        gold: #f2d27a, the request line, p95, the primary button and focus
        healthy: #a8f0c0, Healthy and Resolved with circle and square, and p50
        degraded: #ffd98a, Degraded and Investigating with triangle and magnifier
        recovered: #b8daff, Recovered with a diamond
        firing: #ffb5bf, Firing with an octagon and the error line
    type:
        Iowan Old Style, Palatino Linotype, Palatino, Book Antiqua, Georgia.
        Base 16px at 1.5. The incident ID is 32px, the brand 24px small caps
        tracked 0.08em, pane titles 18px at 600 in small caps tracked 0.1em,
        captions 15px italic, figures with lining numbers.
    layout:
        A header with a quatrefoil mark of four jewel discs and a gold
        centre, Brightwork Ops in small caps with an italic subtitle, and
        the suite apps at right where Ops sits on sapphire with a gold
        underline. Below, one window in a 1200px column. A black lead frame
        with a wide elliptical arched top holds every pane with 6px lead
        gaps. The arched sapphire head pane shows Requests per minute with
        an italic caption and a gold area line chart. Under it, five round
        arched lancets in sapphire, emerald, ruby, amethyst and amber, each
        with a leaded roundel holding the filled status shape, the service
        name, the status word in small caps, a figure and one fact. Then a
        row of three panes, ruby for the open incident with INC-0427, its
        facts and two leaded buttons, amethyst for Error rate and emerald
        for Latency. Then a row of two, amber Alerts and slate Deploys, with
        3px lead rules between rows. A grey sill bar sits under the window.
        Each pane carries a faint diagonal sheen. Below 1000px lancets go
        three across, below 760px two across with billing full width, the
        arch flattens and rows stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 6px lead between panes, 20 to 22px pane padding, 56px top padding under the arch.
    density: Medium. One head pane, five lancets, then rows of three and two panes.
    corners: The frame and head pane share one wide elliptical arch, lancets have round arched tops, everything else is square.
    borders: Lead does the work, a 6px black lead around and between panes, 3px lead between list rows and around buttons.
    shadows: None inside. A faint cool glow around the whole window and a sill bar beneath it.
    icons:
        A quatrefoil mark. Status shapes sit in leaded roundels on the
        lancets, circle, triangle and diamond, and beside the word in lists,
        octagon, square and magnifier.
    focus: A 3px gold outline, a black gap and a second thin gold ring, like a leaded border.
    tone: Quiet and formal, small caps headings and italic captions.
